<title>UK: ROYAL SUN H1 PROFITS RISE TO 501 MLN STG.</title>
<headline>ROYAL SUN H1 PROFITS RISE TO 501 MLN STG.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>(million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		23.5		   vs 22.0</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 7.15		   vs 6.5</p>
<p> Net premiums	     4,624		  vs 4,883</p>
<p> Pretax		     556		    vs 503</p>
<p> Operating result	 501		    vs 450</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 417 and 465 million stg.</p>
<p>Full company name - Royal &amp; Sun Alliance Group Plc  </p>
<p>The results marked the first year of Royal Sun's merged operation and the group said the integration process was still on target to deliver the forecast 175 million stg annualised savings.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7721</p>
</text>
